&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/how-does-ai-adoption-really-work-registration-2003611216083?aff=oddtdtcreator" target="_blank"&gt;REGISTER NOW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the SPS AI Lab&amp;rsquo;s AI Salon, join us for a conversation exploring field notes, successes, and screw-ups in enterprise AI adoption.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
It&amp;rsquo;s been almost four years since the ChatGPT moment, and the speed of adoption and the manner in which AI has entered our everyday conversations&amp;mdash;the wonderful and the horrible&amp;mdash;have touched pretty much everything.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
In this fireside chat, we&amp;rsquo;ll dive into and discuss the intersection and tensions between the impact and reactions of human beings, the initial (and significant) ROI being seen, and the feeling that widespread AI adoption might be inevitable. We&amp;rsquo;ll share examples of both success stories and mistakes, what we&amp;rsquo;ve learned, and what we can do next.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
